WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.544 --> 00:00:03.205 line:3%
  Much of the money work on an SPV  
  still happens by hand.  

2
00:00:04.186 --> 00:00:07.133 line:3%
  One wrong match, and the error carries  
  through the close to the exit.  

3
00:00:08.312 --> 00:00:11.940 line:3%
  Goten books a payment only when its  
  reference matches exactly one investor.  

4
00:00:13.004 --> 00:00:14.395 line:3%
  Anything else waits for a person.  

5
00:00:15.454 --> 00:00:19.030 line:3%
  It writes the chase, and works out the  
  close, down to the amount to wire.  

6
00:00:20.214 --> 00:00:22.617 line:3%
  At the exit, every pound, step by step.  

7
00:00:23.734 --> 00:00:26.250 line:3%
  A person decides, sends and wires.  

8
00:00:27.350 --> 00:00:28.310 line:3%
  Vegeta.  

9
00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:30.760 line:3%
  More modules on the way.  
